"P553549961" "Twisted Reflections"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - OddCurrency 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2865146549" "Detailed Orders"
// DetailString :
"P3117468524" "As Gnarler drops to the ground, you find some orders on him from...you! The Freakshow were ordered to blow up the dam in order to 'create a proper diversion for something'. Your other self doesn't specify what that 'something' is. Though there are details here about how the Freakshow were to properly arm bombs provided by the 5th Column."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - 5thColumnClue2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3474330498" "Monitoring Station"
// DetailString :
"P1409592449" "You hacked the Arachnos computer to discover the base was a monitoring station for Arachnos. The last bit of data you were able to recover detailed some sort of hidden 5th Column base within the Isles, though it seems your evil mirror destroyed the base before more information could be recovered."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Me 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3933124429" "Another You?"
// DetailString :
"P3907348449" "You fought through the destroyed Arachnos base and were ambushed by your mirror self! You defeated the mirror, only to discover that another one attacked Mirror Spirit.<br><br>The mirror version you fought also seemed to be looking for the evil version of you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - YourDouble 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1592774528" "The End of your Evil Double"
// DetailString :
"P115205135" "You were able to defeat your evil double - this time they couldn't teleport away. However, after a few moments, their entire body began to go into wild spasms before something inside of them snapped, killing them instantly.<br><br>You searched your mirror self only to find a set of orders...<br><br><color DarkGray>{HeroName}, you know what you must do. Ruin the reputation of the real you, then kill them before our plans are complete. We will move forward with the next part of the plan afterwards.</color><br><br>There is no signature on the orders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - TwistedReflectionsSouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P4029864700" "S.A.M. Earpiece"
// tDetailString :
"P726227653" "You received this earpiece from Agent Nance as a 'memento' of working together, though you're fairly sure he wants to try to spy on you with it. Regardless, it reminds you of an adventure you call...<br><br><b>Twisted Reflections</b><br><br>It all started when a man named Keith Nance accused you of being a murderous villain. You tried to prove your innocence to him, only to be interrupted by news that <i>you</i> were attacking the Faultline Dam. Despite not trusting you, Nance agreed to work together with you to get to the bottom of this. You went to the Faultline Dam and saved the Dam - and a Wyvern agent - from the Freakshow. However, your evil double was not there. Nance called in to you, saying that your double was spotted by Agent G. It also seemed that Nance was starting to trust you...somewhat.<br><br>You spoke with Agent G, who pointed you towards an Arachnos base within Faultline. You arrived to find the base engulfed in flames! Your other self had been through here, though for what reason you did not know. You hacked an Arachnos computer to discover that the base was being used as a monitoring station by Arachnos. Shortly afterwards, you were attacked - by your mirror! You defeated them only to realize that this couldn't have been the evil you. Nance informed you that the <i>evil</i> you just tried to attack Mirror Spirit. The version of yourself that was defeated was taken into S.A.M. custody while you went to speak with Mirror Spirit.<br><br>Mirror Spirit knew at once that you were not the evil clone and told you where your evil self went. You travelled through the sewers of Faultline and fought your evil self. However, much like yourself, your evil double was connected to a medi-port system!<br><br>You received help from Nance and Citadel to track down where your evil double went, though Nance informed you that your <i>other</i> double escaped S.A.M. custody. You busted into your evil double's base to discover your <i>good</i> double there. The two of you split up - you went after your evil self, while your double went to save Agent Jenni Adair, who had been kidnapped. You fought and defeated your evil self, but could not ask it any questions. Moments after being defeated, your evil self died, most likely from some internal device.<br><br>You returned to Keith, who thanked you for your help, but noted that the investigation wasn't over yet, not when you discovered your clone was working for someone else. While you were able to clear your good name, this would only be the beginning of your work with the S.A.M...."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - AgentG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2835210534" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Two: Just a Misunderstanding </color><br><br>{HeroName}? I've got some questions for you...<br><br>First you storm into the Dam and take it over, then I see you go into an Arachnos base, and now you're here? What do you want?"
// Answer Text :
"P345331736" "The me that attacked the dam wasn't me."
// Answer Text :
"P109383732" "No time to explain, where exactly did you see me go?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1737272041" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Two: Just a Misunderstanding </color><br><br>...what? What are you talking about?"
// Answer Text :
"P532546499" "Look, there's some sort of evil me running around, that's who did this!"
// Answer Text :
"P1938635961" "I don't have time to explain, where exactly did you see me go?"
// Page EvilMe Text :
"P1801949592" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Two: Just a Misunderstanding </color><br><br>An evil you? Hrm...our files didn't have anything on that...<br><br>So you're saying the you that I saw before wasn't you, but another you?<br><br>If that's the case, however, how do I know that you aren't the evil you doubling back?"
// Answer Text :
"P1323593040" "You have to trust me, Agent G. I'm not the evil me."
// Answer Text :
"P4230299917" "There's no time to explain, where exactly did you see me go?"
// Page TrustMe Text :
"P1616820107" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Two: Just a Misunderstanding </color><br><br>You'll have to forgive me if I'm a bit wary, {HeroName}. We've been getting...odd reports lately regarding activity that <i>you've</i> been participating in. Arson...random violence...they didn't seem to match your usual actions here in Paragon, but we've begun to get a bit...suspicious."
// Answer Text :
"P1810756258" "Look, Agent G, it's NOT me. You need to believe me on this."
// Answer Text :
"P3736938058" "I REALLY don't have time to explain! Where did you see me go?!"
// Page BelieveMe Text :
"P1653334269" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Two: Just a Misunderstanding </color><br><br>Alright, {HeroName}. I just hope you can explain all this once it's over."
// Answer Text :
"P3997770579" "Finally! Now, where exactly did you see me go?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P276072008" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Two: Just a Misunderstanding </color><br><br>You went into one of the Arachnos bases perched behind the Dam.<br><br>It looked like there were some Arachnos following you in there as well."
// Answer Text :
"P2622320379" "Arachnos base behind the Dam, got it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MirrorSpirit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2323555234" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: A Brand New Me</color><br><br>{HeroName}. No need to explain yourself.<br><br>I know that this is the real you.<br><br>I was able to sense something different within you from...the you that attacked me. This is all quite...odd.<br><br>I shall do whatever I can to help you, though sadly I cannot accompany you to chase after your double. I have some matters in Faultline that I need to look after."
// Answer Text :
"P2587323137" "Which way did my double go after it attacked you?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1800170761" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: A Brand New Me</color><br><br>Your double fled to the nearby sewers - the ones that run from Faultline to Talos, I believe.<br><br>I was able to slow your evil self down, but {Hero.gender=male he|she} may already be out of the sewers in Talos by now."
// Answer Text :
"P3634179196" "Not if I have anything to say about it. Thank you, Mirror Spirit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - KeithNance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P558599660" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: My Mirror Life</color><br><br>We've got bad news all around, {HeroName}.<br><br>Your double found out that your evil double escaped. {Hero.gender=male He|She} promptly broke out of our custody and is now tracking down your evil self.<br><br>We don't know exactly where your double is...but I believe I know someone who can help us out."
// Answer Text :
"P26076325" "What's the plan? I know my double is somehow involved with the 5th Column..."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2721996999" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: My Mirror Life</color><br><br>Yes, exactly.<br><br>Your clone mentioned using a medi-porter. This must have been one made by the 5th Column.<br><br>I suggest you go to <color yellow>Citadel</color> for help. <i>It</i> has had a lot of experience with the 5th Column, and <i>its</i> expertise with technology should be able to help us out."
// Answer Text :
"P2658268545" "I'm on it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Citadel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3894564742" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: My Mirror Life</color><br><br>{HeroName}, good to see you. I've heard some...disturbing rumors going around that you had become a villain and were terrorizing the city. I hope this is not true. I can assume it's not...unless you are here to request that I arrest you."
// Answer Text :
"P2769239024" "The rumors are false, Citadel. I can explain later, but I need your help."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P160119015" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: My Mirror Life</color><br><br>What do you need my help with, exactly?"
// Answer Text :
"P4036762571" "My evil double used a 5th Column medi-porter to-"
// Page What Text :
"P2516260634" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: My Mirror Life</color><br><br>Your evil double?"
// Answer Text :
"P3377981855" "I don't have time to explain. Can you track a 5th Column medi-porter?"
// Page Track Text :
"P3235527476" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four My Mirror Life</color><br><br>Yes...let me see...<br><br>....<br><br>...there's some movement here. One medi-porter was used recently - an old one. Here's the location of the base.<br><br>I would get there as soon as you can. The 5th's medi-porter technology is very faulty. If your... evil double did use this, {Hero.gender=male he|she} won't be able to use it again for a few hours."
// Answer Text :
"P2242296142" "Thanks, Citadel."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MirrorSelf 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P4038806972" "We don't have much time to talk.  The one I seek is the same one you pursue as well."
// Answer Text :
"P3873413113" "So, you're the good version of me?"
// Page NoIntro Text :
"P1817514817" "I'll handle saving the agents!"
// Answer Text :
"P2588408948" "Right!"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1793786853" "No, you're the good version of me, and I'm here to find the evil version of me."
// Answer Text :
"P4122328403" "Wait, wait, -you're- the mirror of -me-."
// Answer Text :
"P1167777350" "Look, where did you come from? Are you a clone?"
// Answer Text :
"P3209106150" "We're splitting hairs. Did you find the evil version of us?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1195788692" "No...you're the other me...!<br><br>Okay...look...I think we might go about this for days. Let's just settle that for me, you're the mirror me and I'm the original, and for you, I'm the mirror and you're the original."
// Answer Text :
"P3617254418" "Where did you come from? Are you a clone?"
// Answer Text :
"P397192798" "Did you find the evil version of us?"
// Page Clone Text :
"P3467317322" "No, I'm my own being, like you are, just from...somewhere else.<br><br>Where you came from, I came from. Just not in this dimension."
// Page SplittingHairs Text :
"P188606126" "Our evil double is somewhere in here. We could take {Hero.gender=male him|her} down together, just say the word!<br><br><color orange>You remember Keith's last message to you - your evil double's minions kidnapped Keith's superior. If something isn't done, it could be the end for his superior - who was the one person who believed you were innocent in the first place!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P21168667" "I need you to help out S.A.M., one of them was kidnapped."
// Page Luck Text :
"P155325019" "Alright, I'll help them, I'll leave our evil double to you, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2554916056" "{HeroName}, I don't believe I properly introduced myself. But perhaps you already know who I am and are planning to kill me. Nevertheless, good manners should at least be shown by the <i>true</i> patriots of the country. I am <color yellow>Agent Keith Nance</color>, an agent of <color yellow>S.A.M.</color><br><br>Now that we have that out of the way, it's time to get down to business. You've already been...briefed on the situation. 'You' have been sighted in Faultline, causing chaos. Specifically, it appears that you've captured the <color yellow>Faultline Dam</color> with a group of Freakshow.<br><br>What we need you to do is get to that dam and save it from...yourself.<br><br>We've got a Wyvern agent in there who can debrief you on the situation. If you're really on our side, of course.<br><br>If not, well, then we'll know when we find the agent's dead body."
// AcceptString :
"P3989741400" "Funny, Nance. I'll get to the dam and put an end to this."
// SendOffString :
"P1965016471" "Take this <color yellow>earpiece.</color> It will allow me to talk to you while you're away. It also gives me a small view of the area you're in.<br><br>If you're not who you really say you are, I'll know right away - and I'll be ready.<br><br>Good hunting, {HeroName}."
// TaskTitle :
"P463830647" "<color deepskyblue>Twisted Reflections</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1641207927" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Government Boy</color>"

