// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3003943347" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>This is Keith, {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Huh, looks like the Freaks aren't attacking you. Must think you're the other {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Unless you really are {Hero.gender=male him|her}. Let's just say I would bet you're fooling everyone."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3547082886" "I'm digging this whole destruction thing, but this {Hero.gender=male guy|gal} is weird."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4289863766" "Yeah tell me about it, wants us to help blow up the dam, right after I hear that {Hero.gender=male he|she} arrested one of us a week ago!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3374856682" "You're crazier than we are, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
