"P98580087" "Gnarler"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P4118877016" "The fully armored, incredibly tough Tank Freaks are a rare breed indeed. As their name suggests, they're almost unstoppable in combat. The one ray of hope when confronting a Tank Freak is that their electronics are not always top of the line, leaving them vulnerable to energy attacks."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4270047730" "I don't get why you want me to beat you up, but here goes."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2377878767" "You're freakier than we are, you know that?"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1008107500" "Just to let you know, I'm not judging you, okay?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3442652057" "It's your money.  You want me to beat you, I will."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P869368504" "Weirdest way to make a buck, I'm telling you."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2275021173" "What's the deal?  You were the one who wanted to get clobbered, not me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3273861281" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Situation's disarmed. Good work, {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>I've got reports that a man named Agent G saw the 'other' 'you' in Faultline.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>If I were you, I'd get in touch with him."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2729859857" "Well, well, {HeroName}."

