"P1778257844" "You enter the Arachnos base to be greeted by a pillar of smoke. Someone got here before you and destroyed the place!<br><br>You'll have to locate a working computer to see <i>why</i> your evil double did this and where {Hero.gender=male he|she} may have went!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2481264166" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Proof of your innocence is starting to pile up, {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Maybe I was wrong about you, {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>From the looks of this Arachnos base though, doesn't look like your clone was on their side..."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3886774572" "Get this place back in shape! And someone get {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1925671102" "Back to finish the job, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P175436180" "Put {Hero.gender=male him|her} down!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3105062405" "I thought heroes just arrested us. When did burning down our base come into the equation?!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4166968789" "No time to complain. Get things under control, then track down {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3049601073" "Round two {HeroName}. We won't let you get away this time."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2366923748" "...You?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1310978347" "You see before you a strange doppelganger of yourself!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3370868274" "I've got you now, {HeroName}, you won't get away with ruining my name!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2695125318" "Did you think I'd just let you get away with killing all these people?"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3802057842" "Wait...something is...different about you..."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3524191916" "You're trying to confuse me, aren't you?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2347609784" "Your tricks won't work on me, I know what you're up to!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2645559939" "Ugh...you've gotten stronger since our last confrontation...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P4217914675" "Maybe...this was all just a...misunderstanding... <t=4 caption y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Alright, you've got {Hero.gender=male him|her}!<t=4 caption y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>...hold on. This...doesn't make sense.<t=4 caption y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>We've got reports that you just attacked Mirror Spirit. We'll take in this {HeroName} for questioning, you need to speak with Mirror Spirit!"

