// EntryString :
"P585418027" "You can hear the sound of Freakshow laughing in the sewers. It seems your evil double left behind something to keep you busy."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2520950553" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>We've got that double you fought in custody now, {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>{Hero.gender=male He|She} says that {Hero.gender=male he's|she's} out looking for the evil version of {Hero.gender=male himself|herself}. You really need to keep tabs on your other selves.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>I'll let you know if anything develops."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3816899425" "I don't know what game you're playing, {HeroName}, but I'm fine if it lets me smash!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2373577224" "<shout>You're crazy, {HeroName}, but you're paying well, so we'll smash you apart!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1778864643" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Nance here, good news and bad news.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Good news is your double is giving us all the information {Hero.gender=male he|she} has on the evil you.<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>The bad news is that you're about to get ambushed by some Freakshow."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3932562833" "Time to make some good money on some weird people!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4277938202" "So {HeroName} wants us to fight {HeroName}? <em t=2>This {Hero.gender=male guy|girl} some sort of pain lover or something?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3530306971" "Alright, {HeroName}, whatever you want!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3396662476" "...<em>Yeah, that's what we're doing."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1027798591" "Your Evil Mirror"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3206053643" "It's...you! But...not you. Sort of. Whoever this person is, they must be the one responsible for ruining your name!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P224745996" "Alright, just about home free...how many of {HeroName} do I have to do deal with? The 5th Column better have my base ready by now..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P337313302" "Ah, it's me. Or should I say, you? It doesn't matter, soon you'll be dead."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1239953044" "Do you know how enjoyable it is, pretending to be you? All the surprised faces from those you care about!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P118724403" "That other us, {Hero.gender=male he|she} isn't still alive, right? Hrm...another loose end to deal with."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3756848705" "Well...I'll be going now. You're not the only one with a medi-porter!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1738482053" "Nevermind"

