// EntryString :
"P4291632631" "So this is where your double has been working out of.  Even though they managed to bring this base back to full operation, you'll see to it they cause no more harm... and clear your name completely!"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P575920083" "Find your Mirror Self"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2732966215" "Your Doppelganger"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P485276927" "This person seems to match you in every way, shape, and form."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1451635105" "Come out! I'm here to face you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P740735663" "You! So you're trying to ambush me, are you?<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>I'm going radio silence. Some of your evil double's minions have kidnapped my superior!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1083594617" "W-Wait! Hold on! You're the good version of me, we have no reason to fight!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2329560035" "Nooooooooo!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1489206315" "I'll rescue the agents, you make sure to take care of the evil us!"

