// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2130423260" "Smasher"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P249611581" "I'm gonna enjoy pounding your face in, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P148378693" "Basher"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P405706513" "You're in for it now, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2231888844" "Your Evil Doppelganger"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3648339754" "This person appears to be your identical twin, however you can clearly see that they are your evil opposite!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1052860028" "It's time we ended this charade, {HeroName}.  There's only room for one of us!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3308190167" "This little dance we've been doing has been fun, but I have far too much to accomplish to keep this going."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1520715255" "Does it frighten you, to think that you could be replaced by me?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P83043206" "That perhaps your friends, your loved ones, will be left to my...mercy?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P965227720" "This is going to end here, {HeroName}! You, S.A.M., no one can stop this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2347387187" "Urgh...was this it...?! Was that...all I could do? No...I refuse! I refuse to beaten by you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3880182374" "No...not when the medi-porter isn't...u-u-urrghh..."

