// Dialog :
"P3599664356" "{HeroName}, good to see you.<br><br>Your other self arrived in time to help save my superior - <color yellow>Jenni Adair</color>. Your double is now awaiting further orders from us. <br><br>I saw everything that happened in that base with your evil double. Agent Adair has told me that this proves her theory correct...which means this case is in her hands now.<br><br>You'd do well to speak with her to finish this."
// RandomFameString :
"P1287168507" "I'm so relieved that all those things about {HeroName} weren't true!"

